			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Advanced</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Process outside calls: applies the voice to any app recording through the system audio server (for testing). Discovery logging writes every audio unit the audio server uses to the system log, tagged "VoiceForge:". Target: leave as auto, or enter fn:subtype:bus (e.g. render:vpio:1, process:vp4 , any:auvp:*) from the discovery log.</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Process outside calls</string>
